        "description": "<p>As he accepts the Sami Rohr Prize for his memoir and prepares to move back home to Nahal Oz after three years as an evacuee, the Haaretz journalist talks about what still gives him hope</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.timesofisrael.com/award-winning-writer-amir-tibon-readies-to-return-to-kibbutz-where-his-family-survived-oct-7/\">Award-winning writer Amir Tibon readies to return to kibbutz where his family survived Oct. 7</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.timesofisrael.com\">The Times of Israel</a>.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/07/tibon-amir-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Award-winning writer Amir Tibon readies to return to kibbutz where his family survived Oct. 7\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>",
